# Italian property and territory data

When a question is about a place, a property or a parcel **in Italy**, do not answer
from memory: cadastral references, prices and risk classes are per-municipality and
change over time. Use the Zornade MCP server (`https://mcp.zornade.com/mcp`) and
report the data with its source and year.

Flow: address → `zornade_geocode_search`; coordinates → `zornade_parcel_locate`;
cadastral reference → `zornade_parcel_search`; then `zornade_parcel_by_id` for the
full profile. `zornade_admin_lists` resolves region/province/municipality names.

A free API key (`zrn_...`, from <https://app.zornade.com/api>) is required in the
`x-api-key` header. If the key is missing or rejected, ask the user for it rather
than retrying with a guessed value. Attribution is required when the data is
republished: check `meta.licenses` and `meta.zornade_attribution_required` in the reply.
